#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "An overview of variational algorithms: hybrid classical quantum algorithms."
msgstr "Une vue d'ensemble des algorithmes variationnels : algorithmes hybrides classiques-quantiques."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble {#overview}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/variational-algorithm-design/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/variational-algorithm-design/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course is intended for individuals who have some experience with quantum computing and want to learn how to write variational algorithms using IBM Quantum primitives. It is also suitable for quantum computing professionals who want to expand their knowledge and skills in the field of variational algorithms.\n"
msgstr "Ce cours est destiné aux personnes qui ont une certaine expérience en informatique quantique et souhaitent apprendre à écrire des algorithmes variationnels à l'aide des primitives IBM Quantum. Il convient également aux professionnels de l'informatique quantique qui souhaitent approfondir leurs connaissances et compétences dans le domaine des algorithmes variationnels.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Examen {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Variational algorithm design, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Pour obtenir ton badge en conception d'algorithmes variationnels, passe l'examen sur IBM&reg; Training. Cet examen est conçu pour être passé après avoir lu les leçons de ce cours. Après avoir réussi l'examen, tu seras notifié par Credly que tu as obtenu un badge.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Examen](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/exam)\n"

